lt mrecipe/7684 (30 + 10 Blue Reagent + 1 Ibellab's Essence -> 10); also a rare proc when crafting Elixir of Edania at Alchemy Artisan 1+. Elixir of Edania recipe/649 shows base yield 1 and skill 'Skilled 1' on codex page while item text says Artisan 1 is needed for the Strong proc. Alt recipes: Pure Powder Reagent recipe/469 & Clear Liquid Reagent recipe/648 use Weeds instead of Wild Grass (yield 1); Elixir of Concentration recipe/473 (Weeds x8 instead of Wild Grass x2); Oil of Regeneration recipe/373 (Everlasting Herb instead of Red Tree Lump); Elixir of Assassination recipe/434 (Everlasting Herb x2 instead of Red Tree Lump x2); Elixir of Sharp Detection recipe/509 (White Truffle Mushroom). Spellbound Catalyst: not craftable; bought from Old Moon Manager shop, codex lists 1,000,000 silver (verify in-game). Blue Reagent & Ibellab's Essence: NPC vendor. HP Potion (Small), Sugar, Salt: general goods vendor (Salt also heating). Purified Water: Filtering Bottle of River Water (or vendor). Trace of Nature: treated as raw (gathering/lumbering node drop; also obtainable by heating many items). Powders of Flame/Darkness/Time/Earth/Rifts: raw, small chance from mining rocks. Group members: codex tooltip shows max 5 members; extra members with worth=null (Troll Blood for Bear group; Sheep, Waragon for Pig group; Weasel for Fox group) come from item description text and their worth was not verified. Bear Blood description also mentions Rock Elephant Blood (not verified as member). Thai cross-check: user's Fury (Dwarf Mushroom 4, Ash Sap 1, Bear/Lion Blood 4, Purified Water 3) and Frenzy (Ghost Mushroom 2, Cedar Sap 5, Oil of Regeneration 1, Clear Liquid Reagent 5, Trace of Nature 3) match codex exactly. Thai->English elixirs: ความโกรธ=Fury, ความบ้าคลั่ง=Frenzy, การจดจ่อ=Concentration, การทำลายล้าง=Destruction, พลังป้องกัน=Defense Elixir, เกลียว=Helix, พลังชีวิต=Life, แรงกาย=Endurance, วายุ=Wind, คาถาอาคม=Spells, ความสะเทือนใจ=Shock, ความว่องไว=Swiftness, การเจาะ=Perforation, ความตาย=Death, การช่วงชิง=Draining, ยมทูต=Grim Reaper's Elixir, นักลอบสังหาร=Assassination, การรู้เท่าทัน=Detection, นักสังหาร=Elixir of Carnage (Thai name has no แห่ง), ท้องฟ้า=Sky, ความตั้งใจ=Will. กริฟฟอน (Griffon): NOT found on codex as an elixir and not part of this tree - could not identify. Total = 20 draught elixirs + Will = 21 elixirs."}